---
name: review-complete
version: 2.3.0
description: Reviewer completion report for a review bead (review-task); the lead files each finding as a finding bead; the body of `atm task close <task-id> completed`.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - generated_at
  - task_id
  - phase
  - branch
  - commit
  - verdict
  - findings_blocking
  - findings_important
  - findings_minor
  - findings_md
  - integration_review
  - integration_commit
  - post_mortem_counts
  - post_mortem_md
  - post_mortem_jev
optional_variables:
  - notes_md
defaults:
  notes_md: ""
metadata:
  type: review-complete
  tags:
    - stage:review
    - orchestration:beads
  workflow:
    scope:
      kind: phase
      variable: phase
    state: review-complete
    stage: review
    transition: complete
---
# Review Complete

Generated: {{ generated_at }}
Phase/Task: {{ phase }} / {{ task_id }}
Branch: `{{ branch }}`
Reviewed Commit: `{{ commit }}`
Verdict: **{{ verdict }}**

## Machine Status (JSON)
```json
{
  "phase": {{ phase | tojson }},
  "task": {{ task_id | tojson }},
  "branch": {{ branch | tojson }},
  "commit": {{ commit | tojson }},
  "verdict": {{ verdict | tojson }},
  "integration_review": {{ integration_review | tojson }},
  "integration_commit": {{ integration_commit | tojson }},
  "post_mortem_jev": {{ post_mortem_jev | tojson }},
  "post_mortem_counts": {{ post_mortem_counts | tojson }},
  "findings": {
    "blocking": {{ findings_blocking }},
    "important": {{ findings_important }},
    "minor": {{ findings_minor }}
  }
}
```

## Findings
{{ findings_md }}

## Integration Post-Mortem
Outcome: **{{ integration_review }}**
Verified integration head: `{{ integration_commit }}`
Counts: {{ post_mortem_counts | tojson }}
JEV execution: {{ post_mortem_jev | tojson }}
{{ post_mortem_md }}
{% if notes_md %}
## Notes
{{ notes_md }}
{% endif %}
